    "industrial_process_notes": "Not industrially polymerized -- biosynthesized as the main structural component of crustacean/insect exoskeletons and fungal cell walls, and commercially extracted from crab, shrimp, and other shellfish processing byproducts. Deacetylation of chitin under alkaline conditions yields chitosan (see chitosan entry, Era 2).",
